@keycloakHost = http://localhost:8080
@realm = GameStore
@clientId = game-store-ui
@clientSecret = {{clientSecret}}

### 1. Получить токен АДМИНИСТРАТОРА
POST {{keycloakHost}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&
client_id={{clientId}}&
client_secret={{clientSecret}}&
username=admin&
password=admin123

### 2. Получить токен ПОЛЬЗОВАТЕЛЯ
POST {{keycloakHost}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&
client_id={{clientId}}&
client_secret={{clientSecret}}&
username=user&
password=user1

### 3. Получить Service Account токен (Client Credentials)
POST {{keycloakHost}}/realms/{{realm}}/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&
client_id={{clientId}}&
client_secret={{clientSecret}}